    {
      "containers": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "text": "The base mode of this game has a theoretical expected return of 96.7%.\n\nThe player has the option to play <boxer> ON ALL SPINS mode which costs 20x the underlying spin. \n\nIt has expected return of 96.7%. The player has the option to play HOLD AND RE-SPIN feature which costs 200x the underlying spin amount, and guarantees at least 6 Prizes.\n\nIt has an expected return of 96.7%.The maximum win in each Spin Mode is 10,000x the underlying spin.\n\nMalfunction voids all spins and plays. A consistent internet connection is required. In the event of a disconnection, reload the game to finish any uncompleted spins.\n\nThe expected return is calculated over many spins. Movement of reels are not representative of any physical device, and is for illustrative purposes only. TM and © 2025 Twist Gaming.",
          "textImages": {
